suggestion:
awk ロジックを以下に書換え:
```awk
{ prev_mid = mid }
/^### [A-Z][A-Z0-9_-]*:/ { mid = $0 }
/^- \*\*STATUS:\*\*[[:space:]]*BLOCKED/ { in_blocked = 1; has_reason = 0; next }
in_blocked && /^- \*\*BLOCKED 理由:\*\*/ { has_reason = 1 }
in_blocked && /^### [A-Z][A-Z0-9_-]*:/ && NR > 1 {
  if (!has_reason) print "FAIL: BLOCKED without reason: " prev_mid
  in_blocked = 0
}
END { if (in_blocked && !has_reason) print "FAIL: BLOCKED without reason: " mid }
```
（or 先に在 in_blocked ルールを評価するため順序入替）
